{
  "case_id": "BOT-2P-1.21.1",
  "title": "Carpet 玩家 bot（/player）双人联动：建 2 只 bot（3 人现场）→ 以**真实在线玩家**为目标的降神（施法快照 + 目标侧/施法者侧双侧派生值）→ 跨 tick 链接存续 → 狐光「新目标」消耗由**被指定者（bot）的真实近战**触发 → 三种收尾（/player kill 登出、显式 endDescent、/kill 真实死亡）后施法者侧同 tick 自愈归零",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": { "type": "feature", "ref": "carpet-player-bot-2p" },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    { "op": "note", "text": "目的（2026-09-27 用户要求：「向 1.21.1 和 1.20.1 测试端插入 Carpet: NeoForged 模组……在测试脚本中，插入 /player 命令用于创建玩家 bot，该 bot 可被用作测试 2 人及更多玩家的联动功能；使用 /kill 命令击杀 bot 玩家可使其退出」）\n\n**为什么需要它**：此前单人测试世界没有第二名**真实**玩家 ⇒ teru 降神的「另一名玩家」只能用 FakePlayer（不在玩家列表 ⇒ 施法者侧指针每 tick 自愈失败、读数只能取在施法同一次调用内）或「自身脚手架」（施法者 = 目标）。Carpet 的 `/player` bot 是**真 ServerPlayer**：在玩家列表里、参与 tick、可被选为目标、可被 `/kill` 真实击杀（死亡走 `EntityPlayerMPFake#die` → disconnect）。\n\n**本用例覆盖（全是单人环境覆盖不到的）**：\n  ① **bot 生命周期与命令面**：`/carpet <rule> <value>` 设置、`/player <name> spawn [at <pos>]` 建 bot（含离线 UUID 路径）、在线名单规模 (3)、`bot=1` 身份判定（连接类型 = `NetHandlerPlayServerFake`）；\n  ② **真实双人降神**：`castDescent(真实施法者 → 真实目标)` 的快照 50%、+3 层、目标侧写入（`t_caster/t_atkbonus/t_defbonus/t_base/t_fx_d_on`）与施法者侧镜像（`cache` / 护甲折算）；\n  ③ **跨 tick 链接存续**：等待 1.5 s 后双侧读数不变（FakePlayer 路径做不到 —— 它下一 tick 就会被判链接失效）；\n  ④ **狐光「新目标」消耗由被指定者（bot）的真实近战触发**：bot 打**新靶** ⇒ 施法者层数 −1、`t_newt` 0→1、追加攻击力（攻击基数 + 剩余层数）进骰战伤害；同一只靶**再打** ⇒ 不再消耗（对照）；\n  ⑤ **三种收尾后施法者侧自愈**：显式 `endDescent`（双侧同 tick 归零）/ `/player <bot> kill`（目标登出 ⇒ `tickCasterSide` 自愈清零）/ `/kill <bot>`（目标**真实死亡** + 退出）。\n\n**bot 打新靶的三条硬前提**（缺一条额外攻击永远不会被消费，读数是假阴性）：主手近战武器（用例用 `/item replace` 给铁剑）、骰神赐福（`terublessreal give`，6000 tick 长时长避免中途下降沿）、curios `dice` 槽有骰子（`teruequipbot`）。\n\n**读数口径**：`AP_<tag>_*` 见探针 teru 段 `teruStateRead`（施法者侧全量）与 `teruTargetRead`（目标侧，前缀 `t_`）；bot 身份读数由 `teruPlayerRead` 给出（`found/bot/conn/uuid_src/dim/mode/list/names`）。\n\n**如实边界**：bot 没有客户端 ⇒ 只验证**服务端权威**行为（目标选择/快照/状态机/骰战链/生命周期）；「玩家在 GUI 里点选真实玩家」这条交互路径仍由 TERU-SIGN 用例的选择器门控 + 本用例的 `castDescent` 真实施法入口共同覆盖。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/gamemode survival", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/gamerule naturalRegeneration false", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/time set midnight", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..64]", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe teruprep T1 clear", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1200 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "① Carpet 命令面之设置 + 建 bot：`/carpet allowSpawningOfflinePlayers true`（不存在于 Mojang 的玩家名也能造）→ `/player Bot1 spawn`（继承施法者位置/朝向/维度/游戏模式）→ 第二只 bot 偏移 3 格（现场 3 名玩家）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/carpet allowSpawningOfflinePlayers true", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 800 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot1 spawn", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1800 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot2 spawn at ~-3 ~ ~1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1800 },
    { "op": "note", "text": "**归一化（必须，否则用例顺序相关）**：`/player` bot 是**真 ServerPlayer**，走正常存档 ⇒ 它的**背包/手持/属性跨用例重跑保留**。实测第二次跑本用例时 Bot1 仍握着上一轮 `/item replace` 给的铁剑，施法快照的攻击力因此带上武器加成（`A_t` 20→25、`bonus_atk` 10→12、`base` 16→18、`cache` 10→12），断言全变。⇒ 建完 bot 立刻 `/clear`，把手持与护甲清空（curios 槽里的骰子不在背包，`/clear` 不影响，后面由 `teruequipbot` 重新装备）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/clear Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 800 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/clear Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 800 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terubot BT1 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terubot BT2 Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDB BASE Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "② 真实双人降神：先把 Bot1 的骰战链前提备齐（骰子 + 骰神赐福；铁剑稍后给），再走 `castDescent(自身 → Bot1)` 真实施法 —— 目标属性由命令内钉死（攻击力 20 / 护甲 20 / 韧性 0 ⇒ 防御力 12），故期望值可由施法前同口径读数直接算出。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe teruequipbot EQ1 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terublessreal BC1 give Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terucastreal CRE Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDK KEEP Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "④ 被指定者（Bot1）真实近战打**新靶** ⇒ 施法者层数 −1、`t_newt` 记入、追加攻击力进骰战伤害；同一只靶再打一次作对照（不消耗、不追加）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/item replace entity Bot1 weapon.mainhand with minecraft:iron_sword", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terudummy D1 d1 \"minecraft:spider\" 4 1000", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe teruhitreal HR1 d1 1 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1400 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDA1 A1 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe teruhitreal HR2 d1 1 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1400 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDA2 A2 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "⑤-a 显式收尾：`teruendreal`（对真实目标走产品唯一收敛点 endDescent）⇒ 目标侧写入清空、施法者侧镜像/护甲折算同 tick 归零；随后**重新施法**证明链接可重建。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe teruendreal END1 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDE ENDED Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terucastreal CRE2 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDK2 KEEP2 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "⑤-b 目标**登出**：Carpet 的 `/player Bot1 kill`（只对 bot 有效：`cantReMove` 拒绝真实玩家）⇒ bot 退出玩家列表 ⇒ 施法者侧 tick 自愈把镜像缓存与护甲折算清零（这条正是 FakePlayer 路径无法覆盖的）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot1 kill", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terubot BT1G Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDG GONE Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "⑤-c 目标**真实死亡**：与第二只 bot 建链后用原版 `/kill` 击杀（走 `EntityPlayerMPFake#die` → 产品死亡钩子 + disconnect）⇒ bot 退出，施法者侧同样归零。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terucastreal CRE3 Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDK3 KEEP3 Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/kill Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terubot BT2G Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe terureadreal RDG2 GONE2 Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },

    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe teruclear Z", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..64]", "no_esc": true },
